   "stem_html": "<p>For questions 3 – 6, use a graphing calculator to answer the questions.</p>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Find the equation of the line of best fit. What is the value of the correlation coefficient?</li>\n</ol>\n<table class=\"os-raise-skinnytable unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\"></span></th>\n<th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"y\"></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p>5</p></td>\n<td><p>2</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>6</p></td>\n<td><p>4.6</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>7.5</p></td>\n<td><p>7.2</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>8</p></td>\n<td><p>8.4</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>8.3</p></td>\n<td><p>8.2</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>9</p></td>\n<td><p>9.1</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>10.2</p></td>\n<td><p>10.3</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>11.4</p></td>\n<td><p>9.9</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>11.4</p></td>\n<td><p>11</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p>12</p></td>\n<td><p>12.5</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
